  "body": "## What changed\n- Added closed chain indexing (`Chain::new_closed`, `layout_closed`) in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/trochoid_loops.rs`.\n- Extracted `LaneLayout`, `plan_lane_layout`, and `emit_level` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/trochoid_slot.rs` to share single-lane planning across multiple lanes and levels.\n- Split multi-lane and closed-ring planning into `crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch_lanes.rs` (`plan_all_lanes`, `fill_component`, `try_parallel_sub`, `try_residual_medial`) and `crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch_slice.rs` (`slice_angle`, `candidate_angles`, `rotate_to_longest_edge`, `layout_confined`, `rest_share`).\n- Added concentric corner and wall clean-up peeling in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch_clean.rs` (`plan_cleanup`, `round_acute_corners`, `emit_cleanup`).\n- Updated `crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch.rs` to plan all lanes, run clean-up passes per Z level, and enforce confinement and `crossed_pairs`.\n- Added 6 unit pins in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch_tests.rs`, 3 golden tests in `crates/app/tests/adaptive_trochoid.rs`, and `docs/decisions/1587-trochoidal-multi-lane.md`.\n\n## Cause\nThe 2D Adaptive (Trochoidal) planner previously emitted one open medial lane per region. Wide pockets exceeded the single-loop width cap, branching pockets missed secondary lobes, island pockets risked crossing islands or lacked closed ring lanes, and circular loops left excess corner stock unpeeled.\n\n## Tests\n- Unit pins (`cargo test -p camcraft-motion --lib adaptive_troch`, 16 passed, 0 failed; all 6 new pins failed on unchanged base `5a474212`):\n  - `wide_rectangular_pocket_is_cleared_by_parallel_lanes`\n  - `l_shaped_pocket_is_cleared_under_engagement_limit`\n  - `pocket_with_island_is_cleared_without_crossing_or_excess_rest`\n  - `ring_round_island_is_cleared_with_closed_lane`\n  - `triangle_and_wide_to_narrow_neck_are_cleared`\n  - `corner_cleanup_reduces_34x16_rest_to_at_most_hsm_rest`\n- App integration tests (`cargo test -p camcraft-app --test adaptive_trochoid`, 8 passed, 0 failed):\n  - `wide_rectangular_pocket_posts_clean_and_matches_golden`\n  - `l_shaped_pocket_posts_clean_and_matches_golden`\n  - `pocket_with_island_posts_clean_and_matches_golden`\n- Mutation checks:\n  - Restoring base `5a474212` `adaptive_troch.rs` failed `wide_rectangular_pocket_is_cleared_by_parallel_lanes`, `ring_round_island_is_cleared_with_closed_lane`, and `corner_cleanup_reduces_34x16_rest_to_at_most_hsm_rest`; restoring the fix passed all 16 tests.\n  - Bypassing `plan_cleanup` in `adaptive_troch_clean.rs` failed `corner_cleanup_reduces_34x16_rest_to_at_most_hsm_rest` (`troch rest 56.22 mm2 exceeds hsm rest 17.76 mm2`); restoring passed.\n- Clippy: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed with 0 warnings.\n- Quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`): passed `motion` lib, `app` lib, all 92 `camcraft-motion` suites, and all `camcraft-app` suites except `app:winding_align::the_inside_out_stl_fixture_reads_inside_out_and_refuses` (`left: [Outward], right: [InsideOut]`). That failure already exists on base `5a474212` from PR #1686 (`fix(import): turn closed inward STL and OBJ bodies outward`).\n\n## Goldens moved\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/adaptive2d_trochoidal_pocket_face.cl` (updated: trims the duplicate initial rapid at `START` and appends per-level corner and wall clean-up peels)\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/adaptive2d_trochoidal_wide.cl` (new)\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/adaptive2d_trochoidal_l_shape.cl` (new)\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/adaptive2d_trochoidal_island.cl` (new)\n\n## Not exercised\n- Release `--ignored` heavy lanes and GUI pixel snapshots did not run.\n- Physical CNC machining did not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n- PR #1782 (`crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch.rs`, `adaptive_troch_tests.rs`, `mod.rs`, `crates/app/tests/adaptive_trochoid.rs`; touches overlapping files — whichever merges second refreshes).\n\nChangelog: 2D Adaptive (Trochoidal) now clears wide, branching, island, and closed-ring regions with parallel lanes and corner/wall clean-up peels (#1587)\nFixes #1587\n",
